### SECTION D: SECURITY & DATA PROTECTION

**15. Security Stack**  
* Automated SSL/TLS 1.3 encryption with strict HSTS preloading.
* Cloudflare Enterprise-grade Web Application Firewall (WAF) blocking SQL injections, cross-site scripting (XSS), and zero-day exploits.
* Automated DDoS mitigation and rate-limiting against brute force bot attempts.

**16. NDPA 2023 & GDPR Compliance**  
* Granular cookie consent management gating tracking scripts until user opt-in.
* Plain-language Data Privacy Policy compliant with the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 and EU/UK GDPR standards.
* Dedicated Subject Access Request (SAR) and Data Erasure intake mechanisms.

**17. Data Storage, Email Deliverability & Access Governance**  
* Client consultation notes and intake records are encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256). Only authorized Ken-Saleem personnel possess administrative decryption access.
* **Corporate DNS Authentication:** Implementation of SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records to ensure consultation invitations and whitepapers reach corporate inboxes (Microsoft 365, Outlook, Google Workspace) with zero spam-filter interference.

**18. Incident Response & Disaster Recovery Plan**  
* Real-time automated uptime monitoring with instant operational alerting.
* Instant DNS rollback to immutable static backup fallbacks within 120 seconds in the unlikely event of an infrastructure anomaly.

